      {
        "text": "It can let out a mournful wail that causes the soul to shake. When Fang Yuan’s rattan shell grass soldiers clear a path through that sunflower sea, every Ghost Cry Gu lets out a sharp screech and the soldiers ahead collapse. The voices are not the same: some are sharp and frightened, some like sheep bleating, and some seem to recount hidden bitterness.",
        "chapters": [
          428
